---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for HEX Design Labs.">
	<main class="page content-page">
		<section class="page-hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="lead">Last updated: April 30, 2026</p>
		</section>

		<p>
			HEX Design Labs respects your privacy. This policy explains the types of information we may collect when you use this website or contact us, and how that information may be used.
		</p>

		<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
		<p>
			We may collect information you choose to provide through contact forms, email, phone calls, or project inquiries. This may include your name, email address, phone number, company name, website, and message details.
		</p>

		<h2>How We Use Information</h2>
		<p>
			We use submitted information to respond to inquiries, discuss services, provide project support, improve this website, and maintain business records.
		</p>

		<h2>Analytics and Website Data</h2>
		<p>
			This website may collect basic usage information such as pages visited, browser type, device type, and general location data through analytics or hosting tools.
		</p>

		<h2>Information Sharing</h2>
		<p>
			We do not sell personal information. We may share information with service providers who help operate the website, manage communications, or deliver services, when needed for normal business operations.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>
			Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@hexdesignlabs.com">info@hexdesignlabs.com</a>.
		</p>
	</main>
</Layout>
